# Scene1-1-9

; ========================================
; ＞『図書室』を選択
; ========================================
@AutoSave
[PrintTextModified Text:监牢二楼可以进的房间只有两个。<br>一个是图书室，一个是娱乐室。|#0101Adv13_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:12_1
@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000 Duration:1.2 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.8
@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_11_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛和雪莉决定<br>去图书室看一看。|#0101Adv13_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:图书室内的书架整齐地排列着，<br>空气中飘着一股老旧的纸香味，呈现出静谧的气氛。|#0101Adv13_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:这里会有什么书呢。|#0101Adv13_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛随手拿出一本书翻了起来，<br>可上面写的全是看不懂的字。|#0101Adv13_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:唔……看不懂……|#0101Adv13_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:这不是我们国家的文字呢。<br>这座监牢究竟在哪个国家？<br>难不成……是异世界！？|#0101Adv13_Sherry001| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:你、你不要说这么令人绝望的话啦！|#0101Adv13_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉也从书架上拿出一本书，<br>随意的翻动着。|#0101Adv13_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛，艾玛！<br>快，快来看这个！|#0101Adv13_Sherry002| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopBgm
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:40 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:见雪莉朝她挥手，<br>艾玛的视线也往书上面移动。<br>只见打开的那一页上面写着——|#0101Adv13_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:<color=#ff0000>救命</color>|#0101Adv13_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Fearful1,ArmR3,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:血红的字迹写着这么一句话。<br>艾玛倒吸一口凉气。|#0101Adv13_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_27_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:2
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:这个难道是之前被抓的预备魔女<br>在上面写的！？|#0101Adv13_Sherry003| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:可能是……|#0101Adv13_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:令人兴奋耶～！|#0101Adv13_Sherry004| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:一点都不兴奋啦！|#0101Adv13_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1

@ResetText


[PrintTextModified Text:其他书上会不会<br>也留下了这类信息呢。<br>你要不要再调查一下？|#0101Adv13_Sherry005| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopBgm

[PrintTextModified Text:对于雪莉的建议，艾玛——|#0101Adv13_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@AddChoice ChoiceSummary:表示赞成|#0101Adv13_Choice001| Lock:false ButtonPath:ChoiceButtons/Adv/Bad AutoPlay:true ShowHandler:true
    @GotoModified Path:Act01_Chapter01/Act01_Chapter01_Bad03 ResetState:-

@AddChoice ChoiceSummary:摇了摇头|#0101Adv13_Choice002| Lock:false AutoPlay:true ShowHandler:true
    @GotoModified Path:.Choice1-1-3
@AutoSave DelayDuration:0.3
@StopForChoice Clear:false

# Choice1-1-3

@RecordCorrectChoice Number:3

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:摇了摇头。|#0101Adv13_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:现在还是算了。总觉得<br>刚刚的血字好吓人……|#0101Adv13_Ema006| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:而且要调查这么多书的话，<br>我觉得应该多找几个人来比较好……|#0101Adv13_Ema007| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:——哎呀。|#0101Adv13_Margo001| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:在某个书架的阴影处，有一位少女<br>稍稍探了探头看向这边。|#0101Adv13_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR1,ArmL1
@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_11_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:你叫玛格……对吗。你原来在这里啊。|#0101Adv13_Ema008| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Normal1,ArmR5,ArmL3

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯。听到有小鸟在这里唱歌，<br>我就想看看是什么情况。|#0101Adv13_Margo002| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:不、不好意思吵到你了。|#0101Adv13_Ema009| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:没关系啦。<br>我在这里没找到能看的书，正愁没事可干呢。|#0101Adv13_Margo003| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:她边说着，边迈着轻飘飘的步伐走到了别处。<br>明明没有招呼她们，艾玛和雪莉却像着了魔似的，跟在了她后面。|#0101Adv13_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:阅读区的一张小桌子上<br>铺满了卡片。|#0101Adv13_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:这是塔罗牌，对吗？|#0101Adv13_Sherry006| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯。是放在娱乐室的，我把它拿过来了。<br>我本来就很喜欢塔罗牌哦。|#0101Adv13_Margo004| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:要不要我来帮你们<br>占卜一下呢？|#0101Adv13_Margo005| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:难道玛格你是通过<br>塔罗牌使用魔法的吗？|#0101Adv13_Sherry007| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:玛格坐在椅子上，露出一个妖艳的微笑。|#0101Adv13_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:不是的。你们为什么想到问这个？|#0101Adv13_Margo006| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:我很好奇，大家都会用一些<br>怎样的魔法，好奇得不得了！|#0101Adv13_Sherry008| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:玛格不禁笑了起来。|#0101Adv13_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Smile1,ArmR5,ArmL3

[PrintTextModified Text:真可爱。|#0101Adv13_Margo007| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:和设想相反，玛格没有直接配合提问，<br>而是边笑着摇了摇头。|#0101Adv13_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不过，很抱歉，<br>我不能告诉你们我会用怎样的魔法。|#0101Adv13_Margo008| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:如果说，之后这座监牢内会发生凶杀案，<br>你们难道不觉得，暴露手里的底牌是很愚蠢的吗？|#0101Adv13_Margo009| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:听玛格这么讲，<br>艾玛不禁皱起眉头。|#0101Adv13_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我相信不会发生凶杀案的。|#0101Adv13_Ema010| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:玛格拿出一张牌，<br>放在了艾玛和雪莉面前。|#0101Adv13_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Normal1,ArmR1,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:【塔】的正位。<br>……在不久的将来，会有某个人死去。|#0101Adv13_Margo010| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:明明只是普通的占卜，<br>但玛格的话却莫名地有说服力。|#0101Adv13_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你们也要小心周遭的事物。<br>毕竟我们没法知道，哪个人的身上埋藏着杀意。|#0101Adv13_Margo011| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:太过分了……竟然要让我怀疑其他人……|#0101Adv13_Ema011| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Smile1,ArmR5,ArmL3

[PrintTextModified Text:哎呀。我们只不过才认识了一天，<br>你还真是善良……还是应该说是天真呢。|#0101Adv13_Margo012| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:明明每个人之间都不是很熟悉，<br>为什么你会选择相信别人？|#0101Adv13_Margo013| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Determined2

[PrintTextModified Text:我……不、不过！<br>至少我觉得，她们不是会下手杀人的人！|#0101Adv13_Ema012| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你最熟悉的那位二阶堂希罗，<br>不是比谁都要更早地展露出杀意了吗？|#0101Adv13_Margo014| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆言葉に詰まる

[PrintTextModified Text:……|#0101Adv13_Ema013| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:玛格的脸上仍堆着满面的笑容，<br>可是她的话语就像一把锋利的刀，狠狠刺伤了艾玛。|#0101Adv13_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Determined2

[PrintTextModified Text:眼看艾玛和玛格之间要掀起一股波浪，<br>雪莉便插到了她们两人中间。|#0101Adv13_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:那个，我们该走啦，<br>艾玛！|#0101Adv13_Sherry009| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯……|#0101Adv13_Ema014| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:打搅了！<br>我们下次再来跟你讨教你的事哦。|#0101Adv13_Sherry010| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:呵呵……想要占卜的话，<br>随时来跟我说哦。|#0101Adv13_Margo015| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

